{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:25 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1d6422503a3087cb299e6d3631f0e39/2026-10/2a4662a9-748e-4d24-9660-2705322989da_3.jpg\"/>\n<p>今日（18日）下午2時許，警方接獲報案，指一對70多歲的夫婦倒卧屯門山景邨景榮樓的寓所內，奄奄一息，救援人員趕到現場，發現二人已陷昏迷，旁邊有一盤已燒過的炭，隨即將他們送往屯門醫院搶救。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:39:30.090803+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:25:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:35.331681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:37:33.926946+00:00","content_hash":"65e8e6e54f4585ea676f3cb5f0b92fb6a53a2ac96e82f81db7950a99e381f3c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}